# #4186, rewritten for #4358 — NEGATIVE PROOF fixture for chorus:PrincipleShape.
# Every row here VIOLATES the shape on purpose; the bats asserts each violation is
# reported. If this file ever validates clean, the shape has gone shallow again.
@prefix chorus: <https://jeffbridwell.com/chorus#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

# 1. a quotation, not one of ours: no jeffReading, no techReading, no source
chorus:hemenway-fixture-quotation a chorus:Principle ;
    chorus:ownedBy chorus:principal-fixture ;
    rdfs:label "Observe" ; rdfs:comment "Use protracted and thoughtful observation." ;
    chorus:order 1 .

# 2. no Hemenway number
chorus:hemenway-fixture-unnumbered a chorus:Principle ;
    chorus:ownedBy chorus:principal-fixture ;
    rdfs:label "Connect" ; rdfs:comment "Use relative location." ;
    chorus:source "Hemenway, T. Gaia's Garden, 2nd ed., p. 6." ;
    chorus:techReading "Place elements so they create useful relationships among all parts." ;
    chorus:jeffReading "Jeff draws the map before he places the bed; adjacency is the design." .

# 3. a row named off the hemenway-<slug> format
chorus:xp-fixture-humanity a chorus:Principle ;
    chorus:ownedBy chorus:principal-fixture ;
    rdfs:label "Humanity" ; rdfs:comment "Software is written by people." ;
    chorus:source "Hemenway, T. Gaia's Garden, 2nd ed., p. 6." ;
    chorus:techReading "Roles are not interchangeable executors; the attention contract exists for this." ;
    chorus:jeffReading "Tone is product. When tone drops his budget goes to stabilising, not creating." ;
    chorus:order 3 .

# 4. an order outside 1..14 and a citation in another spelling
chorus:hemenway-fixture-out-of-range a chorus:Principle ;
    chorus:ownedBy chorus:principal-fixture ;
    rdfs:label "Fifteenth" ; rdfs:comment "There is no fifteenth Hemenway principle." ;
    chorus:source "Hemenway, T. Gaia's Garden, 2nd ed. (Chelsea Green, 2009), p. 6." ;
    chorus:techReading "A number past the set is a number nobody can look up in the book." ;
    chorus:jeffReading "Jeff keeps the Gaia's Garden list; fourteen, not fifteen." ;
    chorus:order 15 .
